on and sign are missing.","The stated air density cannot be derived from temperature and humidity alone without pressure, and the venue/time distribution used for the value is not shown.","Cr is given only as a wide range, with no selected value or calibration for the plotted output-speed curves, preventing reproduction of rolling resistance.","The prose calls r an inner diameter while the geometry treats it like a radius; later tables also mix radius and angle fields, so the turn input convention is inconsistent.","The force sum, efficiency division, rider-mass-normalized output, and total rider-plus-bicycle mass do not receive one explicit dimensional and sign-convention closure.","The source uses total turn length relative to course length to ignore turn time and speed transitions, but short sharp turns can have nonproportional braking, acceleration, energy, and safety effects.","The strategy treats controls as section-boundary steps while Equation (10) retains acceleration and later guidance assumes finite braking; the state transition is not reconciled.","Equation (12) leaves the relationship between t and tn, control bounds, initial/final speeds, continuity, and the integration of local turn limits unspecified.","Mathematica Minimize is named without domains, starting values, precision, stopping rules, convergence status, grid size, or a discretization-refinement check.","Turn output and speed values lack units, and the reported 12.13 output for turn E cannot be checked against a duration-specific response constraint from the table alone.","Calling roughly 400 m long enough to hold an optimum is not supported by approach speed, acceleration time, braking distance, or a steady-state distance calculation.","Small-slope aggregation is motivated by approximate trigonometric linearity but no error is propagated to speed, chosen output, resource use, or completion time; Equation (14) is also visually ambiguous.","Rows labeled like #55km/#56km and values such as 0.2m