d 493 without carrying the hard-constraint failures and uncertainty needed for a decision.","The manager letter prints separate 'which' where the intended term is orbits.","Internal headers show page 21 of 20 and page 22 of 20; the denominator was not updated for the letter.","The final three lines are stranded on an otherwise almost empty page, creating an avoidable orphan and pagination defect."],"unresolved_resolved":[],"validation_results":[{"details":"22/22 text pages and 22/22 rendered pages passed extraction checks; complete page-aware visual review is recorded.","status":"pass","validator":"validate_extraction.py"},{"details":"382 language units cover all 12 unique declared protocol chapters with quantitative layouts, reusable slots, variants, and boundaries.","status":"pass","validator":"validate_language_units.py"},{"details":"382/382 units passed with two unrelated original instantiations, no full-clause matches, and no source-fact leaks.","status":"pass","validator":"validate_language_anticopy.py"},{"details":"27 model and algorithm interfaces retain 15 visually reconciled equations plus inputs, conditions, handoffs, validation links, and limitations.","status":"pass","validator":"validate_model_units.py"},{"details":"12 five-part chapter contracts, the complete Introduction paragraph chain, positive organization artifacts, 15 visual dispositions, and 59 last-pass warnings passed.","status":"pass","validator":"validate_learning_audit.py"},{"details":"The paper card, 861 observations, cumulative B rules, extraction, language/model records, and complete visual review cross-validate.","status":"pass","validator":"validate_paper_artifacts.py"},{"details":"12 nominated B rules received one evidence binding each without lifecycle changes; staged and live canonical outputs are byte-identical at 9c4e15d52e522b3b422a6b03a4b83d97604c57d3654ba4c99a495715c36d5851.","status":"pass","validator":"apply_rule_impacts.py"},{"details":"The live plan retains language-first 