ltural sources are named incompletely and lack one frozen retrieval ledger.","Only five references are listed although many external data and domain claims appear throughout the paper.","The core calibration table has only five annual observations, two dominated by pandemic disruption.","Keeping 2020-2021 zeros to infer environmental or social development without tourists does not identify tourism's causal effect.","Linear revenue and fixed revenue per tourist suppress visitor mix, price, inflation, season, and capacity effects.","Treating tourism as the only cause of Juneau environmental harm excludes climate, shipping, development, and other drivers.","A constant natural recovery rate is asserted without calibration, seasonality, thresholds, or uncertainty.","S_peak and S_off are assumed stable but no estimation sample, values, fit, or uncertainty is published.","Equation (1) introduces delta(t) without a distribution, scenario path, seed, or propagation into reported results.","The tax elasticity gamma has no source, estimate, unit convention, or uncertainty interval.","Equation (3) subtracts beta times the numerical cap, so a higher allowed cap lowers growth; this is not reconciled with cap stringency or the prose.","M(t)=lambda G(t) fixes promotion as a tax-revenue share but lambda, budget timing, and competing uses are not specified.","M(t) changes meaning among promotion, general government spending, environmental intervention, and multi-category allocation.","Equation (4) uses a fixed per-tourist revenue coefficient without source, year, currency basis, or fit diagnostics.","Equation (5) applies tau to total tourism revenue, but the legal and accounting tax base is not established.","Equation (6) gives fixed and variable costs without values, provenance, depreciation, public-service costs, or uncertainty.","Equation (7) does not reconcile annual revenue, cost timing, government revenue, spending, or monetary units.","Equation (8) does not freeze x_min and x_