eaves training labels and similarity construction unspecified, and combines negative f(m), nonnegative clipping, and sum-to-one normalization inconsistently.","The 0.5-to-0.9 comparison is a constructed local arithmetic example, not empirical evidence that text weighting improves detection.","Spanish words, anxiety, complaints, and alleged guilty conscience are speculative semantic inferences without annotation protocol, false-positive analysis, or contextual review.","Figure number 7 is reused, and the biological transfer substitutes inverse distance and IR-like scores without target dynamics, units, labels, interventions, or validation."],"unresolved_resolved":[],"validation_results":[{"details":"All 20 physical pages retain text and 200-DPI rasters; title, Summary, and Introduction are present, no separate Abstract exists, and the symbols table, figure-only continuation, and References remain excluded from positive language evidence.","status":"pass","validator":"validate_extraction.py"},{"details":"Pages 1-20 were read twice in physical order; ranking assumptions, staged simplification, PageRank/SNA contrast, iRank iteration, task results, semantic repair, recommendations, and biological transfer remain source-anchored.","status":"pass","validator":"source_coverage_audit"},{"details":"The audit records problem decomposition, assumption-triggered simplification, intuition-before-formula exposition, result-to-candidate handoff, limitation-triggered semantic repair, and qualified cross-domain transfer.","status":"pass","validator":"human_style_learning_audit"},{"details":"140 source-anchored language units cover eight normalized positive chapters and retain rhetorical function, information order, slots, variants, boundaries, examples, and anti-copy restrictions.","status":"pass","validator":"validate_language_units.py"},{"details":"All 140 units and unrelated examples passed with zero full-clause matches, zero source-fact leaks, and no unique shingle reuse.","statu