de model.","The plume expression fixes a 500-unit vertical offset and omits source height definition, ground reflection, stability class, deposition, boundaries, and units.","Country emission density is converted to AQI using one year's paired ranges without demonstrating pollutant compatibility or correlation strength.","The AQI breakpoint interpolation is repurposed for aggregate national emissions despite incompatible pollutant, temporal, and spatial units.","Nations with too little data are deleted without an inventory, missingness rule, or selection-bias analysis.","Figure 4 is captioned stepwise forecast while the prose describes an autonomous holdout forecast after 30 training years.","Autonomous forecasts explicitly exclude policy and other exterior influences, yet later case studies attribute forecast-actual divergence to policy reforms.","Accumulated recursive error is admitted, but no valid horizon, calibration curve, stability diagnostic, or uncertainty band is reported.","Local verification is declared equivalent to global verification without testing aggregation, network cascades, or global tipping behavior.","Fit is judged satisfactory by eye; no loss, baseline, holdout metric, confidence interval, or leakage check is supplied.","The criticality function is improvised with arbitrary scales and exponents, grows with distance, and is not validated against impact outcomes.","Figure 5 shows only selected important nations and provides no selection rule, numeric labels, comparator, or error assessment.","Removing China and retraining changes both topology and fitted parameters; seeds, splits, and metrics are not controlled, so Figure 6 does not isolate relationship sensitivity.","Figure 7 has no quantitative legend, color scale, source mapping, uncertainty, or reproducible country values.","Japan's forecast divergence is labeled an irreversible 1993 tipping point without an observed transition, threshold, or reversibility test.","India's no-reform counterfactual is inferred from a policy-free autonomous path without an intervention variable or causal design.","Hungary's policy effect and optimal-decision claim likewise rely on historical coincidence and forecast-actual divergence.","Country cases switch between fit verification, warning, counterfactual, and causal interpretation without separate metrics or validation protocols.","The conclusion claims complete functionality and decision support beyond the qualitative and confounded evidence shown.","The authors admit only 30 training samples, omitted factors, high sensitivity, link-function difficulty, and long training, but supply no repair experiment.","No executable code, frozen data, fitted weights, source-country list, software versions, random seeds, or machine-readable forecasts are supplied."],"unresolved_resolved":[],"validation_results":[{"details":"All 19 pages retain text and 200-DPI rasters; title, Summary Sheet Abstract, Introduction, and Conclusion are present, and Contents, cited figure wording, and References remain outside positive prose.","status":"pass","validator":"validate_extraction.py"},{"details":"Pages 1-19 were read twice in physical order; AQI framing, BP-to-PSO switching, local/global recurrence, emission proxy, verification downgrade, criticality, country cases, and admissions remain source-anchored.","status":"pass","validator":"source_coverage_audit"},{"details":"The audit retains named BP setback, PSO switch, century-horizon rejection, error admission, improvised criticality repair, matched comparison, plot-to-warning handoffs, and bounded conclusion language.","status":"pass","validator":"human_style_learning_audit"},{"details":"200 source-anchored language units cover eight normalized positive chapters and retain function, order, slots, variants, boundaries, dispositions, and anti-copy restrictions.","status":"pass","validator":"validate_language_units.py"},{"details":"All 200 reviewed author-prose units passed; maximum shared conte